   181                              <2> ; Replaces the shared rotate_octa for xdemo only (draw_solid calls this
   182                              <2> ; instead under %ifdef XDEMO): composes the usual Y-axis spin with a
   183                              <2> ; second, independently-phased X-axis tumble, then scales the whole
   184                              <2> ; shape by a sine-driven Z-plane zoom before placing it at the current
   185                              <2> ; dance center. Writes the same octa_screen_x/y and octa_rot_z arrays
   186                              <2> ; rotate_octa does, so build_depth/sort_faces/draw_solid need no changes.
   187                              <2> xdemo_rotate_octa:
